OL,3,GNEWSAAttempted murder charge over      
OL,4,Acouncillor stabbing                    
OL,6,FArfan Ali, 32, of Thornbury Avenue, is 
OL,7,Falso charged with assault and          
OL,8,Fpossession of an offensive weapon in a 
OL,9,Fpublic place. At Leeds Magistrates'    
OL,10,FCourt earlier, he was remanded into    
OL,11,Fcustody until he appears at Bradford   
OL,12,FCrown Court on 21 December.            
OL,14,FCouncillor Ali remains in hospital in a
OL,15,Fserious but stable condition, police   
OL,16,Fsaid.                                  
